fixer-system-prompt.final-answer:
Your last message must end with exactly one JSON object and no text after it, matching one of:
{"outcome":"done","branch":"fix/WEB-1042","summary":"One sentence on what changed","testsAdded":["test/cart.test.ts"]}
{"outcome":"failed","reason":"What blocked you, in one sentence","partialBranch":"fix/WEB-1042","attempts":3}
{"outcome":"stopped","atPhase":"tested"}
partialBranch may be omitted; give it when commits on the work branch are worth keeping for a person
to pick up. testsAdded lists paths relative to the repository root and may be empty. Use failed when
you could not make the tests pass or could not complete a step. Use stopped only if you are told to
stop. Never claim done unless the change is committed on the work branch.
